(text "Bus = bench wiring verified Nov 18/20. J5/J6 pin 4 never to ESP32.\nCable straight-through, not the crossed stock cable.\nANSWERED (SPEC Q2, Nov 21): Freenove board has NO diode between USB VBUS and its 5V pin. JP1 stays.\nOPEN (SPEC Q3): HB_5V sags 4.7 V -> 4.1 V with the slave's logic on it. Find what is in series before link pin 4. Not resolved." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 116.84 160.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0bcab291-22e5-41b7-a53e-05b986f3501f"))
